EVA.

1140
00:39:10,876 --> 00:39:11,977
YAYA.

1141
00:39:13,712 --> 00:39:14,780
TOCCARA.

1142
00:39:16,515 --> 00:39:18,083
JENNIPHER.

1143
00:39:19,718 --> 00:39:21,019
CASSIE.

1144
00:39:22,988 --> 00:39:24,756
YOU LOOK LIKE YOU WERE
GIVING UP OVER THERE, CASSIE.

1145
00:39:24,756 --> 00:39:26,091
Cassie: NO.

1146
00:39:27,259 --> 00:39:32,064
Tyra: THE NEXT NAME THAT I WILL
CALL--NORELLE.

1147
00:39:32,064 --> 00:39:34,066
SHOWING THAT PRETTY NEW
SMILE, AREN'T YOU?

1148
00:39:39,204 --> 00:39:40,606
Tyra: ANN.

1149
00:39:42,975 --> 00:39:45,410
THE NEXT NAME THAT
I'M GOING TO CALL--

1150
00:39:45,410 --> 00:39:46,645
KRISTI.

1151
00:39:48,347 --> 00:39:49,781
Tyra: YOU WERE HAVING
A PANIC ATTACK OVER THERE.

1152
00:39:49,781 --> 00:39:50,782
Kristi: YOU HAVE NO IDEA.

1153
00:39:50,782 --> 00:39:51,917
Tyra: CONGRATULATIONS, KRISTI.

1154
00:39:53,218 --> 00:39:55,854
WILL JULIE AND KELLE
PLEASE STEP FORWARD?

1155
00:39:57,489 --> 00:40:01,193
I ONLY HAVE ONE PHOTO
IN MY HANDS.

1156
00:40:01,193 --> 00:40:06,198
AND THIS PHOTO REPRESENTS THE
GIRL THAT WILL CONTINUE

1157
00:40:06,198 --> 00:40:10,402
IN THE RUNNING TOWARDS BECOMING
AMERICA'S NEXT TOP MODEL.

1158
00:40:10,402 --> 00:40:12,504
THE GIRL'S NAME THAT
I DO NOT CALL

1159
00:40:12,504 --> 00:40:16,475
MUST IMMEDIATELY
RETURN TO YOUR APARTMENT,

1160
00:40:16,475 --> 00:40:19,144
PACK YOUR BELONGINGS
AND LEAVE.

1161
00:40:22,581 --> 00:40:26,351
YOU TWO HAD SOME OF THE
WORST PICTURES IN THE BUNCH--

1162
00:40:26,351 --> 00:40:30,522
NO INTENSITY,
NO FIRE AND NO PASSION.

1163
00:40:30,522 --> 00:40:33,258
KELLE, YOU
PLAYED THE BLAME GAME.

1164
00:40:33,258 --> 00:40:36,328
YOU DON'T TAKE RESPONSIBILITY
FOR YOURSELF.

1165
00:40:36,328 --> 00:40:39,932
IT IS IMPORTANT TO HEAR
THE CRITIQUE AND SAY,

1166
00:40:39,932 --> 00:40:41,366
"I CAN DO BETTER,"

1167
00:40:41,366 --> 00:40:43,602
NOT "SOMEONE ELSE CAN
CHOOSE A BETTER PHOTO ."

1168
00:40:43,602 --> 00:40:47,105
JULIE, YOU SAID THAT
YOU WANT TO BE HERE

1169
00:40:47,105 --> 00:40:50,208
TO FURTHER YOUR CAREER IN
FASHION MERCHANDISING

1170
00:40:50,208 --> 00:40:51,543
OR MANUFACTURING.

1171
00:40:51,543 --> 00:40:54,246
NOT ONCE DID YOU SAY YOU
WANT TO BE A TOP MODEL.

1172
00:40:54,246 --> 00:40:56,014
I FEEL LIKE YOU
BOTH LACK PASSION,

1173
00:40:56,014 --> 00:40:58,850
AND I'M SO DISAPPOINTED
IN BOTH OF YOU.

1174
00:41:05,123 --> 00:41:06,258
Tyra: KELLE.

1175
00:41:07,626 --> 00:41:08,827
CONGRATULATIONS.

1176
00:41:08,827 --> 00:41:10,162
Kelle: THANK YOU SO MUCH.

1177
00:41:10,162 --> 00:41:11,697
Tyra: YOU'RE STILL IN THE
RUNNING TOWARDS BECOMING

1178
00:41:11,697 --> 00:41:13,165
AMERICA'S NEXT
TOP MODEL.

1179
00:41:13,165 --> 00:41:14,399
Kelle: I CAN DO BETTER.

1180
00:41:14,399 --> 00:41:16,001
Tyra: THERE YOU GO.

1181
00:41:16,001 --> 00:41:17,002
THANK YOU, JULIE.

1182
00:41:17,002 --> 00:41:18,236
Julie: THANK YOU.

1183
00:41:21,039 --> 00:41:22,541
I REALLY ACTUALLY THOUGHT I WAS
GONNA GET FARTHER,

1184
00:41:22,541 --> 00:41:24,843
BUT, I MEAN, THE TRUTH CAME OUT.

1185
00:41:24,843 --> 00:41:27,312
I SAW THIS AS A DREAM FOR NOW,
BUT THEN I SAW

1186
00:41:27,312 --> 00:41:28,914
A BIGGER DREAM
IN THE END.

1187
00:41:28,914 --> 00:41:31,650
MY MAIN DRIVE WASN'T MODELING,
AND IT'S THE FIRST TIME

1188
00:41:31,650 --> 00:41:33,819
IN MY LIFE WHEN I'M REALLY
HONEST ABOUT SOMETHING,

1189
00:41:33,819 --> 00:41:36,855
AND I BLOW IT HERE. AND BESIDE
THAT,

1190
00:41:36,855 --> 00:41:38,256
IT'S OVER NOW.

1191
00:41:52,137 --> 00:41:54,806
TYRA: STAY TUNED FOR SCENES
FROM OUR NEXT EPISODE...

1192
00:41:58,276 --> 00:42:00,645
COMING UP ON "AMERICA'S
NEXT TOP MODEL, "

1193
00:42:00,645 --> 00:42:03,648
THE GIRLS STRUT THEIR STUFF
WITH MISS J. ALEXANDER.

1194
00:42:03,648 --> 00:42:04,783
J.: YOU'RE ABOUT TO
FALL, BUT YOU'RE NOT

1195
00:42:04,783 --> 00:42:05,517
LETTING IT HAPPEN.

1196
00:42:05,517 --> 00:42:06,785
Eva: IT'S NOT GONNA FALL.

1197
00:42:06,785 --> 00:42:07,586
J.: OH!

1198
00:42:07,586 --> 00:42:08,587
Tyra: AND THEY DO IT
WITH THE HELP

1199
00:42:08,587 --> 00:42:09,621
OF LAST YEAR'S WINNER...

1200
00:42:09,621 --> 00:42:12,724
Man: MISS "AMERICA'S NEXT TOP
MODEL" HERSELF...

1201
00:42:12,724 --> 00:42:13,925
Tyra: YOANNA.

1202
00:42:13,925 --> 00:42:16,361
Tyra: A SURPRISE RUNWAY SHOW
IS A DREAM COME TRUE

1203
00:42:16,361 --> 00:42:17,229
FOR NORELLE.

1204
00:42:17,229 --> 00:42:18,463
Women: (screaming)

1205
00:42:18,463 --> 00:42:20,032
Tyra: BUT WILL
AMANDA'S NIGHT BLINDNESS

1206
00:42:20,032 --> 00:42:22,367
BE HER RUNWAY TO ELIMINATION?

1207
00:42:22,367 --> 00:42:23,602
Amanda: I'M GETTING
SCARED NOW.

